{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/507fa5c2733bb0086e74f62958cbd7e2.poster.avif?t=1761923070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/507fa5c2733bb0086e74f62958cbd7e2.webm?t=1761923070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/507fa5c2733bb0086e74f62958cbd7e2.mp4?t=1761923070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a father trying to guide his children to safety through a terrifying, creature-infested world. You can command them to follow you or stay hidden, but every choice could mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person stealth horror experience,\u00a0 you can\u2019t fight back. Your only defense is staying quiet, moving carefully, and finding safe routes through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: reach the safe zone <strong>with your family alive</strong>. If you escape alone, you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience, timing, and courage are your only tools for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your children to follow or hide to avoid danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense stealth gameplay with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror and sound-driven tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and unpredictable creature encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/add9e90edd4f809a3a7b8b62c858492e.poster.avif?t=1761923070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/add9e90edd4f809a3a7b8b62c858492e.webm?t=1761923070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/add9e90edd4f809a3a7b8b62c858492e.mp4?t=1761923070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning:</strong><br> <br> Contains depictions of fear, death, and loud screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits: </strong><br> Voice Acting by\u00a0TK Billington</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087030?t=1761923070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087030?t=1761923070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/b21a58412a6a51533624319cb18e73c5c3828944/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761923070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/b21a58412a6a51533624319cb18e73c5c3828944/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761923070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Death of characters in the game, screams, crying. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/extras/507fa5c2733bb0086e74f62958cbd7e2.poster.avif?t=1761923070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4